{"event": "turn", "session_id": "bfc4b3a6b85f4a8384bb92c9b4e80e86", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:30:17.758233+00:00", "message": "介绍白茶", "resolved_question": "介绍白茶", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 15.149, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 5636, "output_tokens": 783, "response": {"answer": "白茶是一种按加工方式划分的茶类，不是用白色花朵或草本植物泡的饮品。\n\n**定义与工艺**\n- 依据 ISO 20715:2023《茶 — 茶类分类》，白茶指采摘的茶梢经过**萎凋和干燥**两个阶段加工而成。\n- 因此“白茶”既指山茶（Camellia sinensis）这一茶类，也指一种加工方式，而非白色花朵或香草冲泡的饮品。\n- 来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types（年份：2023）\n\n**容易混淆的一点**\n- 茶树品种（cultivar）与茶类（type）是两个不同概念：白茶、绿茶、乌龙茶、红茶、黄茶、黑茶描述的是加工后的产品类型。\n- 有研究（FAO AGRIS 收录）显示，同一品种用六种典型方法加工，会得到不同的化学成分特征，说明品种本身并不决定成品茶类或香气，加工方式同样关键。\n- 来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves（FAO AGRIS 收录，年份未标注）\n\n**关于风味、用途、价格、库存**\n- 本次工具未提供白茶的风味、口感、功效用途、价格或库存信息，这些无法验证，暂不能介绍。\n- 如需选购，请告诉我具体想了解的白茶商品，我再按实时数据为您查询。\n\n如果您想进一步了解白茶的分类细节或与其他茶类的区别，可以继续问我。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Typology of Processed Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/zh/records/68cbbca2f61e5b80b5e93a95", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "介绍白茶", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "diagnostics": [], "compliance_blocked": false, "explained_categories": [], "pii_redacted": false}, "retrieval": [{"original_query": "介绍白茶", "rewrite_status": ["translated"], "rewrite_error_types": [], "rejected_variants": 0, "queries": [{"round": 0, "query": "介绍白茶", "limit": 15, "hits": 15, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "Introduce white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "介绍白茶 | white tea", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}, {"round": 0, "query": "白茶是什么", "limit": 5, "hits": 5, "status": "success"}], "rerank_status": ["success"], "retry": false, "retry_adopted": false, "retry_reasons": [], "selected_ids": ["66", "67", "77", "78", "57"], "remaining_issues": [], "missing_subjects": []}]}
